# Stripe Price IDs for Billing checkout (Vercel Production env on manyhandz-v2).
# Create these in Stripe Dashboard — Price unit_amount cannot be edited in place.
#
# Small Business monthly: AUD $499.00  (unit_amount 49900, recurring month)
# Big Business monthly:   AUD $999.00  (unit_amount 99900, recurring month)
# Enterprise: custom — no Stripe Price in-app
#
# Do not reuse legacy IDs (they still charge the old amounts):
#   price_1U6On9Ex2m1vqgKrd4WcbAo5  Small Business $199/mo
#   price_1U6OnAEx2m1vqgKribI5jcGM  Small Business annual $1,399/yr
#   price_1U6tqpEx2m1vqgKrwkDcVZnu  Big Business $499/mo
#   price_1U6tquEx2m1vqgKrgYZmvdMo  Big Business annual $4,199/yr
VITE_STRIPE_PRICE_SMALL_BUSINESS_MONTHLY=
VITE_STRIPE_PRICE_BIG_BUSINESS_MONTHLY=
